-- Questing WT35b: the executor uses quest items (on creatures, corpses, objects, locks, at a spell focus) and class
-- spells at an objective now, so the failure record forgets the give-ups it counted for them: every
-- `unsupported:item` row (also those of item objectives that stay undoable, a vendor's or a made item: the next
-- failure writes them again with their right cause), and the unsupported:event, no-target, timeout and abandoned
-- rows of the 777 quests with a use rule and a place (`playerbots planner questuse all` on lab13, 2026-11-21)
